{"2022670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SONIC SUPERSTARS", "steam_appid": 2022670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2376684, 2376680, 2376683, 2504600, 2376681, 2376685, 2549530, 2376686], "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p></p><br><h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/d1de02474819b8abad100c5cf35f641f.avif?t=1783397336\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>SONIC SUPERSTARS Digital Deluxe Edition featuring LEGO®</strong> contains SONIC SUPERSTARS and the Digital Deluxe Upgrade featuring LEGO®, which includes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-LEGO® Fun Pack </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Rabbit Skin </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mecha Sonic Skin for Battle Mode </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Bonus Main Menu Wallpapers​ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Digital Artbook &amp; Mini Original Soundtrack</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through the mystical Northstar Islands in this all-new take on classic 2D Sonic high-speed action platforming. Play as Sonic, Tails, Knuckles, and Amy and harness all-new Emerald powers to move and attack in dynamic new ways. Navigate gorgeous, never-before-seen environments solo or with up to 3 other players and stop Dr. Eggman, Fang, and a mysterious new adversary from converting the islands’ giant animals into Badniks before it’s too late!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A new Spin on a Classic:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 2D Sonic high-speed sidescrolling action platforming is reimagined with fully 3D graphics, new powers and abilities, an all-new setting, and new ways to play! You’ve never played classic Sonic like this before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/0a7c0959c63be8e5af545660b2b3646b.poster.avif?t=1783397336\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/0a7c0959c63be8e5af545660b2b3646b.webm?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/0a7c0959c63be8e5af545660b2b3646b.mp4?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as your Favorite Characters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from Sonic, Tails, Knuckles, and Amy and take advantage of their unique abilities to blaze a path across the Northstar Islands as they race to defeat Dr. Eggman, who has teamed up with an old nemesis, Fang, and a mysterious new armored adversary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/e0ff2b3a8c71db2d5c88ccc938597b49.poster.avif?t=1783397336\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/e0ff2b3a8c71db2d5c88ccc938597b49.webm?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/e0ff2b3a8c71db2d5c88ccc938597b49.mp4?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harness the Power of the Chaos Emeralds:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the new Emerald Powers, choose from 7 different abilities including Multiply, swim up waterfalls, and even change your form. Explore new parts of the map, unlock new abilities, and unleash devastating special abilities against your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/c019c3d3db73b0d6dff819f17196b566.poster.avif?t=1783397336\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/c019c3d3db73b0d6dff819f17196b566.webm?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/c019c3d3db73b0d6dff819f17196b566.mp4?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Friends, More Fun:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the entire campaign with up to 3 other players with 4-Player Local Co-op and Compete locally or online with up to 8 players in the all-new Battle Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/3e1360d1acf1e1b0eb5966c5cf149f17.poster.avif?t=1783397336\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/3e1360d1acf1e1b0eb5966c5cf149f17.webm?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/3e1360d1acf1e1b0eb5966c5cf149f17.mp4?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through the mystical Northstar Islands in this all-new take on classic 2D Sonic high-speed action platforming. Play as Sonic, Tails, Knuckles, and Amy and harness all-new Emerald powers to move and attack in dynamic new ways. Navigate gorgeous, never-before-seen environments solo or with up to 3 other players and stop Dr. Eggman, Fang, and a mysterious new adversary from converting the islands’ giant animals into Badniks before it’s too late!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A new Spin on a Classic:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 2D Sonic high-speed sidescrolling action platforming is reimagined with fully 3D graphics, new powers and abilities, an all-new setting, and new ways to play! You’ve never played classic Sonic like this before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/0a7c0959c63be8e5af545660b2b3646b.poster.avif?t=1783397336\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/0a7c0959c63be8e5af545660b2b3646b.webm?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/0a7c0959c63be8e5af545660b2b3646b.mp4?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as your Favorite Characters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from Sonic, Tails, Knuckles, and Amy and take advantage of their unique abilities to blaze a path across the Northstar Islands as they race to defeat Dr. Eggman, who has teamed up with an old nemesis, Fang, and a mysterious new armored adversary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/e0ff2b3a8c71db2d5c88ccc938597b49.poster.avif?t=1783397336\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/e0ff2b3a8c71db2d5c88ccc938597b49.webm?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022670/extras/e0ff2b3a8c71db2d5c88ccc938597b49.mp4?t=1783397336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h